# No Compatibility Wrappers Left Behind

- Do not leave compatibility wrappers, aliases, or temporary bridge APIs in the codebase.
- Use wrappers only as short-lived migration aids when strictly necessary.
- Before considering a task complete, remove migration wrappers and update all in-repo callsites to the final API.
- Prefer one clear code path over dual-path compatibility logic.
